{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0179",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "在櫻花樹長出嫩葉的時節，我再次偷偷帶著靜子的和服腰帶和貼身襯衫去當鋪，用換來的錢跑去銀座喝酒。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When the cherry trees were putting out young leaves, I once again secretly took Shizuko's kimono sash and undershirt to a pawnshop, then used the money to go drinking in Ginza.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "連續兩晚夜不歸宿，到了第三天晚上，實在覺得過意不去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After staying out for two nights in a row, by the third night I felt truly ashamed,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "才下意識躡手躡腳地又來到靜子的公寓門前，屋子裡傳來她們倆的對話：「為什麼要喝酒？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and only then, almost unconsciously, I crept back to the door of Shizuko's apartment, where I heard the two of them talking inside: \"Why do you drink?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "「爸爸可不是因為喜歡酒才喝的，是因為他人太好了，所以……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Daddy isn't drinking because he likes alcohol; it's because he is too good-hearted, so...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "「好人都要喝酒嗎？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Do all good people drink?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "「也不能這麼說……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"It is not exactly like that...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "「爸爸肯定會嚇一跳的。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Daddy will surely be surprised.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「說不定會討厭呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Maybe he will hate it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "你看，你看，又從箱子跳出來了。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look, look, it jumped out of the box again.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「就像急性子的小平君一樣。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Just like impatient little Ping.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00179",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "「是啊。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Yes.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
